## Verdict

- Novel peptides (1% class FDR): model **446** vs null **374** across 12 populations.
- PC-churn: canonical PSMs 9,961,958 (baseline) -> 9,307,176 (model, -654,782) -> 8,481,926 (null, -1,480,032). The null DB displaces 825,250 MORE canonical PSMs than the model DB.
- Net PSM: model 9,994,995 vs null 10,074,790.

